{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べろべろべー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめか♡2012.4.13"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうぅぅーーー‼\nひーめーかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに同い年‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいかわいいひめか、\nしっかり者で明るくて\nダンスの表現が上手で\n強くて一生懸命。\n見習いたいところ沢山あるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あー\nこれ以上見つめないでね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おねーちゃん倒れちゃうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかは私の妹♪\nそして私はおねーちゃんー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい\n(ひめかブログより)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におめでとう**"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼に学校終わると電車が\nがらんがらんすっきすっきなの。\n座ってるとき、ぽかぽかするから寝ちゃう^^\n静かですき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家まで歩いて帰る道\nそんなに人がいない\n風がきもちよい\nあの時間はいちばんすきやわ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うたってても平気\nスキップしてても平気"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなお花咲いてます。\n全部きれい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぼーっと眺めてその後撮って見る。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がしかし、いちばん手前の花が虫に食われてる。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＜へたくそ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これよく見るお花だけどなんの花じゃろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔面に風が当たってぶぉさぶぉさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音漏れ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっぺな、かいたら赤くなってん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"GalileoGalilei♪\n東京事変♪\n相対性理論♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小声でおいでシャンプーうたってみたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(...おーいで シャーンープー)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえば、今日クラス一人ずつ自己紹介した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みょーに緊張して口から心臓飛び出そうだったぜ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「えー、こほん。\n一年から来ました、伊藤万理華です。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...... おうまいがっっっつ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょっぱな間違えた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年から来た\nそりゃみんなそーや、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは初選抜の歌はどんな歌が歌いたいですか？\nまりかの好きな歌はなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな歌でも‼\n特別こんなのがいいとかないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな歌は、、\nゆるいロック\nつぶやく感じの可愛らしいの\nとかかっこいいアップテンポもすきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べびたんが集めているマスコットは何ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集めてない...かなぁx("},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タメ語でコメントしていいのかな(´･_･`)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいよいいよー‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも写真の加工がすごくかわいいけど、\nどんなアプリ使ってるのか知りたいなぁ～(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pixlromatic\nPuddingCam\nLens＋\nなど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんはキス魔なんか？笑っ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魔が付くほどじゃない笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華ちゃんはよく狙われるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...なんでかね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、まりかちゃんより年下なんです。年下によんでほしいあだ名があれば言ってください！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？おねいちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか先輩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\n調子乗りすぎな自分が..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くそぅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん呼び捨てでも嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というかなんでも良いですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はいよいよ静岡でのスタジアムライブ‼\nアンダー全員でスタジアムを盛り上げるぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勇気は左の胸に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も元気に頑張り⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴょーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/13/2384987/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}